  <section class="prose" aria-label="Teaching overview">
    <p class="lede">I teach trombone, euphonium, and low brass at two Twin Cities universities &mdash; first-year students through graduate students, majors and non-majors. If you&rsquo;re considering either school, come play for me before you audition. A sample lesson is free, and you&rsquo;ll learn more about the studio in that hour than an audition day will ever tell you.</p>
  </section>

